# 3. ENFORCE HTTPS

All production agent communication must use HTTPS.

The following must be prohibited in production:

```text
http://api.qguardhelix.com
http://localhost:3000
http://127.0.0.1
```

Production must use:

```text
https://api.qguardhelix.com
```

or the configured production control-plane hostname.

Implement:

* TLS 1.2 minimum
* TLS 1.3 preferred
* certificate validation
* hostname validation
* secure HTTP client defaults
* connection timeout
* retry policy
* exponential backoff
* bounded retries
* connection failure handling

Do not implement:

```text
DisableCertificateValidation
TrustAllCertificates
IgnoreSslErrors
```

or equivalent behavior.

Never allow the agent to silently downgrade HTTPS to HTTP.

