# 4. OPTIONAL HIGH-SECURITY MODE: MUTUAL TLS

Design the architecture so Qguard Helix can support mutual TLS.

Preferred production architecture:

```text
                 QGUARD CONTROL PLANE
                         │
                    HTTPS / mTLS
                         │
                ┌────────▼────────┐
                │ Qguard Agent    │
                │ Device Identity │
                └─────────────────┘
```

After enrollment, the agent should receive or generate a device-bound identity.

Prefer:

```text
Agent private key
        +
Agent certificate
        +
Qguard CA
```

The private key must:

* never be transmitted to the control plane
* never be logged
* never be displayed
* be stored using Windows-protected mechanisms where practical
* be inaccessible to standard users

Design the system so certificate rotation is supported.

